It's due by 5:00 today.

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:07,540
M: Thanks for the reminder.

4
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,340
I've been so busy these days.

5
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:11,060
Who did you nominate?

6
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:15,600
W1: I thought Kevin Schroeder did a great job during the past couple of months.

7
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,360
W2: You can say that again, Lisa.

8
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:23,390
He managed to bring in several new clients, four of whom are from Europe.

9
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:27,095
M: I had no idea he was doing such a great job.

10
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:28,880
Isn't he relatively new?

11
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,020
W1: Not really.

12
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:36,200
He's been employed here for three years, but he's rarely in the office, so that's why you don't see him too often.
